    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADP301 · Chapter 5 · Session 24 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 24 — Final Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13657 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADP301 · Chương 5 · Buổi 24 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 24 — Final Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13657 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1,CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5, CLO6, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1,CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5, CLO6, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Final Assignment 1</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Syllabus, Slide, Textbook, Reference</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Assignment 1: Market Research and Design Direction Proposal for a Packaging System<br>(Choose a company/shop/brand in any product category)<br>Deliverables:<br>1. A PDF file presenting the Market Research and the Packaging System Design Direction.<br>2. A PDF file documenting the process of AI application and evidence of personal adjustments during the project development.<br>Requirements:<br>The research and design direction must cover the following components:<br>* Market Research<br>- Brand introduction: trade name, market segment, sales channels (traditional market/supermarket/e-commerce), target distribution areas.<br>- Products: shape, specifications/volumes, features–functions–usage, current materials, product lines/categories. Include visual illustrations.<br>- Customer personas: minimum of 2 personas with visual representation, purchasing behavior, motivations–barriers, and packaging selection criteria.<br>- Product market development (if applicable): domestic/export, specific requirements (transportation, display, legal compliance).<br>- Competitors (direct/indirect): logos, key products, SWOT analysis, quick comparison on “physical shelf” and “digital shelf” (thumbnail effect in online display).<br>* Packaging Direction (present 3 distinct directions)<br>- Packaging levels: Primary, Secondary, Tertiary packaging applicable to each product line (SKU).<br>- Design direction: structure/die-cut/materials; style–color palette–typography. Present design direction with moodboards, proposed color schemes, fonts, reference images/icons, and sample packaging design examples.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
